&\frac{1}{T_{x}}=\frac{1}{T_{1}}-\frac{k \ln 10}{\Delta H_{v}}=\frac{1}{1073}-\frac{1.38 \times 10^{-23} \times \ln 10}{2 \times 1.6 \times 10^{-19}}=8.33 \times 10^{-4} \\
&T_{x}=1200 \mathrm{~K}= \boxed{928}^{\circ} \mathrm{C}
