\end{aligned}
\]
$f_{V}=A e^{-\frac{\Delta H_{V}}{k_{B} T}}=1.1 \times e^{-\frac{1.03 \times 1.6 \times 10^{-19}}{1.38 \times 10^{-22} \times(20+273)}}=2.19 \times 10^{-18}$
vacancy density at $20^{\circ} \mathrm{C}= \boxed{1.85e5} \mathrm{~cm}^{-3}$']

